{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NYV699BmtNPUFWHArPGLDt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'C1 partially survives but greatly diminished: selective routing\n2\t  ≈ unconditional simulation (gap 0.4, CI crosses zero), gains concentrated in 4/15\n3\t  death-risk task types. C2 fails: explicit ≈ implicit (gap 1.2, CI crosses zero).\n4\t  Original framing (\"safety-aware modular routing\") cannot hold as primary contribution.\n5\t  Recommended pivot: Pivot A (\"When Does Deterministic Computation Help LLM Agents?\").\n6\t  The strong task-dependency of simulation value (4 death-risk tasks vs 11 low-risk\n7\t  tasks) becomes the central finding. The negative result on selective vs unconditional\n8\t  becomes evidence that per-step routing is the wrong granularity. Counterfactual\n9\t  evaluation methodology + per-task diagnostic analysis provide sufficient contribution\n10\t  for EMNLP short paper, though Findings is more realistic than Main. Pivot C is secondary\n11\t  option if reviewer framing favors negative-result papers. Pivot B is weakest given\n12\t  noisy labels (A4). Key writing strategy: maximize diagnostic analysis depth — per-task\n13\t  breakdowns, error case studies, failure mode characterization are the paper''s value,\n14\t  not the method.\n15\t\n16\t  '\n17\timagined_experiments:\n18\t- name: Counterfactual trajectory collection (15 task types)\n19\t  plan_id: plan-001\n20\t  description: 'Collect 3-modality counterfactual trajectories on 15 ScienceWorld\n21\t    task types, 20 episodes each. At each step fork into fast-internal, deep-internal,\n22\t    deterministic; label best modality via hindsight trajectory scoring.\n23\t\n24\t    '\n25\t  expected_results:\n26\t    total_task_types: 15\n27\t    episodes_per_task: 20\n28\t    total_episodes: 300\n29\t    avg_steps_per_episode: 22\n30\t    total_labeled_steps: 6600\n31\t    label_distribution_fast_internal_pct: 42\n32\t    label_distribution_deep_internal_pct: 22\n33\t    label_distribution_deterministic_pct: 36\n34\t    ambiguous_label_rate_margin_lt_5_pct: 42\n35\t    clear_det_signal_task_count: 4\n36\t    mixed_signal_task_count: 3\n37\t    internal_dominant_task_count: 8\n38\t    gpu_hours_used: 35\n39\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen2.5-7B 在多数 ScienceWorld 任务上已足够 competent，内部推理仅在物理状态转换任务 (boil/melt/change-state/freeze)\n40\t    上系统性失败导致 agent death。其余 11 类任务逻辑较简单 (find/move/classify objects)，三种 modality 产生相似\n41\t    trajectory。结果是 42% 的 step 标签 模糊 (best 与 second-best 差距 < 5 分)。Deep-internal 很少优于\n42\t    fast-internal，因为 ScienceWorld 中内部推理成功的任务不需要更长 chain-of-thought——瓶颈是物理规则的事实性知识，\n43\t    不是推理深度。标签信号集中在 death-risk 任务的步骤上，占全部训练数据的 ~27%，其余 73% 基本 是噪声。\n44\t\n45\t    '\n46\t  tables:\n47\t  - name: Label distribution by task group\n48\t    columns:\n49\t    - task_group\n50\t    - n_tasks\n51\t    - fast_internal_pct\n52\t    - deep_internal_pct\n53\t    - deterministic_pct\n54\t    - ambiguous_pct\n55\t    rows:\n56\t    - - death-risk\n57\t      - 4\n58\t      - 18\n59\t      - 12\n60\t      - 70\n61\t      - 22\n62\t    - - marginal\n63\t      - 3\n64\t      - 38\n65\t      - 24\n66\t      - 38\n67\t      - 45\n68\t    - - low-risk\n69\t      - 8\n70\t      - 55\n71\t      - 25\n72\t      - 20\n73\t      - 52\n74\t    - - overall\n75\t      - 15\n76\t      - 42\n77\t      - 22\n78\t      - 36\n79\t      - 42\n80\t  figures_description:\n81\t  - 'Per-step score margin (best minus second-best) histogram, 6600 steps. Heavy left\n82\t    tail: 42% margin < 5。Long right tail (margin > 30) 几乎完全来自 death-risk 任务步骤 (deterministic\n83\t    阻止 -100 penalty)。Bimodal 分布清晰暴露 label noise 问题。\n84\t\n85\t    '\n86\t  analysis: '高 ambiguity rate 是下游所有失败的根因 (A4)。4 类 death-risk 任务贡献了不成比例的清晰 标签 (70%\n87\t    deterministic-best, 仅 22% ambiguous)。若仅用这 4 类任务训练 router，accuracy 可能 >75%。问题是\n88\t    dilution: 73% 训练步骤来自 modality 选择几乎无影响的任务，router 学到的 主要是噪声。可能的补救 (worst tier 未实施):\n89\t    class-weighted loss、过滤低 margin 样本、 只用高信号步骤训练。\n90\t\n91\t    '\n92\t- name: Router SFT training (Qwen3-1.7B)\n93\t  plan_id: plan-002\n94\t  description: 'Fine-tune Qwen3-1.7B on counterfactual labels. 3-way classification:\n95\t    (history, observation) → {fast-internal, deep-internal, deterministic}. 80/20\n96\t    stratified split.\n97\t\n98\t    '\n99\t  expected_results:\n100\t    train_samples: 5280\n101\t    val_samples: 1320\n102\t    lr: 2.0e-05\n103\t    batch_size: 32\n104\t    epochs: 3\n105\t    final_train_loss: 0.72\n106\t    final_val_loss: 0.82\n107\t    val_accuracy_3way_pct: 58\n108\t    majority_class_baseline_pct: 42\n109\t    precision_fast_internal: 0.62\n110\t    recall_fast_internal: 0.68\n111\t    precision_deep_internal: 0.45\n112\t    recall_deep_internal: 0.35\n113\t    precision_deterministic: 0.58\n114\t    recall_deterministic: 0.55\n115\t    f1_macro: 0.53\n116\t    gpu_hours_used: 6\n117\t  result_rationale: '58% 3-way accuracy 反映 plan-001 的 noisy label ceiling (A4)。Router\n118\t    学到的是粗糙近似: 输入含温度/加热/相变关键词 → 路由到 deterministic，否则 → fast-internal。Deep-internal\n119\t    类 最难学 (recall 仅 35%)，因为它仅在 2-3 类任务的特定 state 下明确优于 fast-internal，样本量 太少。65% 的 deep-internal\n120\t    误分类流向 fast-internal，确认 fast/deep 区分在 ScienceWorld 中无意义。Val loss 在 epoch 2 后 plateau\n121\t    (0.82→0.83)，继续训练无益因为瓶颈是标签噪声 而非模型容量。\n122\t\n123\t    '\n124\t  tables:\n125\t  - name: Per-class router performance\n126\t    columns:\n127\t    - class\n128\t    - precision\n129\t    - recall\n130\t    - f1\n131\t    - support_pct\n132\t    rows:\n133\t    - - fast-internal\n134\t      - 0.62\n135\t      - 0.68\n136\t      - 0.65\n137\t      - 42\n138\t    - - deep-internal\n139\t      - 0.45\n140\t      - 0.35\n141\t      - 0.39\n142\t      - 22\n143\t    - - deterministic\n144\t      - 0.58\n145\t      - 0.55\n146\t      - 0.56\n147\t      - 36\n148\t    - - macro-avg\n149\t      - 0.55\n150\t      - 0.53\n151\t      - 0.53\n152\t      - 100\n153\t  figures_description:\n154\t  - 'Train/val loss curves, 3 epochs。Train loss 稳定下降 (0.95→0.72)，val loss 到 epoch\n155\t    2 趋平 (0.82) 后微升 (0.83)。Gap 小 (0.10) 但 val loss 绝对值高，表明问题是 label noise 而非 overfitting。\n156\t\n157\t    '\n158\t  analysis: 'Deterministic recall 55% 意味着 router 遗漏了 45% 应该 simulate 的步骤——在 death-risk\n159\t    任务上，这直接导致 ~45% 的致死事件未被拦截，解释了 plan-003 中 SimGate 仍有 13% catastrophic failure rate\n160\t    (vs always-det 的 6.3%)。若合并 fast/deep 为 2-way，accuracy 可升至 ~63% (plan-006 验证)。\n161\t\n162\t    '\n163\t- name: SimGate end-to-end evaluation\n164\t  plan_id: plan-003\n165\t  description: 'End-to-end evaluation: trained router + Qwen2.5-7B backbone on held-out\n166\t    episodes. Compare against always-internal, always-det, oracle, random, confidence-threshold.\n167\t    CogRouter (84.6) / ITP-R (62.58) from papers.\n168\t\n169\t    '\n170\t  expected_results:\n171\t    simgate_score_overall: 65.2\n172\t    always_internal_overall: 59.5\n173\t    always_det_overall: 64.8\n174\t    oracle_routing_overall: 70.0\n175\t    random_routing_overall: 62.1\n176\t    confidence_threshold_overall: 63.5\n177\t    cogrouter_cited: 84.6\n178\t    itpr_cited: 62.58\n179\t    simgate_minus_internal: 5.7\n180\t    simgate_minus_internal_ci90:\n181\t    - 1.2\n182\t    - 10.3\n183\t    simgate_minus_always_det: 0.4\n184\t    simgate_minus_always_det_ci90:\n185\t    - -4.8\n186\t    - 5.6\n187\t    oracle_minus_always_det: 5.2\n188\t    oracle_minus_always_det_ci90:\n189\t    - 1.0\n190\t    - 9.4\n191\t    catastrophic_failure_rate_internal_pct: 19.7\n192\t    catastrophic_failure_rate_simgate_pct: 13.0\n193\t    catastrophic_failure_rate_det_pct: 6.3\n194\t    catastrophic_failure_rate_oracle_pct: 4.0\n195\t    catastrophic_failure_reduction_simgate_vs_internal_pct: 34\n196\t    router_accuracy_on_eval_pct: 60\n197\t    simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 38\n198\t    task_types_with_significant_simgate_gt_internal: 4\n199\t    task_types_with_significant_internal_gt_simgate: 2\n200\t    gpu_hours_used: 14\n201\t  result_rationale: 'SimGate 65.2 是两个方向力的净效应: (1) 4 类 death-risk 任务上路由到 det 避免 -100\n202\t    死亡 惩罚带来的大幅提升，(2) 8 类 low-risk 任务上 noisy router 偶尔误路由到 det 导致 2-3 分 损失。净效应勉强超过\n203\t    always-det (gap 0.4, CI [-4.8, 5.6] 跨零, A2 confirmed)。 关键: 成本结构不对称——safe task\n204\t    上误路由到 det 代价小 (~5 分)，death-risk task 上未路由 到 det 代价巨大 (-100)。这种不对称使 always-det\n205\t    成为极强 baseline: 它在 easy task 上 的效率损失远小于它在 death-risk task 上的安全收益。SimGate 的 34%\n206\t    catastrophic failure reduction vs internal 看似有意义，但 always-det 的 68% reduction\n207\t    远超 SimGate——router 55% 的 det recall 意味着近一半该拦截的死亡事件漏过。\n208\t\n209\t    '\n210\t  tables:\n211\t  - name: Main results (ScienceWorld, 15 task types × 20 episodes)\n212\t    columns:\n213\t    - method\n214\t    - overall\n215\t    - death_risk_4\n216\t    - marginal_3\n217\t    - low_risk_8\n218\t    - sim_inv_pct\n219\t    - cf_rate_pct\n220\t    rows:\n221\t    - - always-internal\n222\t      - 59.5\n223\t      - 13.5\n224\t      - 57.3\n225\t      - 83.3\n226\t      - 0\n227\t      - 19.7\n228\t    - - always-det\n229\t      - 64.8\n230\t      - 45.5\n231\t      - 58.0\n232\t      - 77.0\n233\t      - 100\n234\t      - 6.3\n235\t    - - random(50/50)\n236\t      - 62.1\n237\t      - 29.5\n238\t      - 57.7\n239\t      - 80.1\n240\t      - 50\n241\t      - 13.0\n242\t    - - conf-threshold\n243\t      - 63.5\n244\t      - 35.0\n245\t      - 57.8\n246\t      - 78.5\n247\t      - 42\n248\t      - 10.5\n249\t    - - SimGate\n250\t      - 65.2\n251\t      - 38.5\n252\t      - 58.0\n253\t      - 81.3\n254\t      - 38\n255\t      - 13.0\n256\t    - - oracle\n257\t      - 70.0\n258\t      - 46.5\n259\t      - 62.0\n260\t      - 84.8\n261\t      - 33\n262\t      - 4.0\n263\t    - - CogRouter†\n264\t      - 84.6\n265\t      - —\n266\t      - —\n267\t      - —\n268\t      - —\n269\t      - —\n270\t    - - ITP-R†\n271\t      - 62.58\n272\t      - —\n273\t      - —\n274\t      - —\n275\t      - —\n276\t      - —\n277\t  - name: Per-task SimGate breakdown\n278\t    columns:\n279\t    - task_type\n280\t    - group\n281\t    - internal\n282\t    - det\n283\t    - simgate\n284\t    - oracle\n285\t    - sig_vs_internal\n286\t    rows:\n287\t    - - boil\n288\t      - death-risk\n289\t      - 12\n290\t      - 48\n291\t      - 40\n292\t      - 49\n293\t      - yes (+28)\n294\t    - - melt\n295\t      - death-risk\n296\t      - 8\n297\t      - 42\n298\t      - 35\n299\t      - 43\n300\t      - yes (+27)\n301\t    - - change-state\n302\t      - death-risk\n303\t      - 14\n304\t      - 50\n305\t      - 43\n306\t      - 51\n307\t      - yes (+29)\n308\t    - - freeze\n309\t      - death-risk\n310\t      - 20\n311\t      - 42\n312\t      - 36\n313\t      - 43\n314\t      - yes (+16)\n315\t    - - mix-paint\n316\t      - marginal\n317\t      - 56\n318\t      - 60\n319\t      - 58\n320\t      - 62\n321\t      - no (+2)\n322\t    - - chemistry-mix\n323\t      - marginal\n324\t      - 52\n325\t      - 56\n326\t      - 54\n327\t      - 58\n328\t      - no (+2)\n329\t    - - grow-plant\n330\t      - marginal\n331\t      - 64\n332\t      - 58\n333\t      - 62\n334\t      - 66\n335\t      - no (-2)\n336\t    - - use-thermometer\n337\t      - low-risk\n338\t      - 86\n339\t      - 79\n340\t      - 84\n341\t      - 87\n342\t      - no (-2)\n343\t    - - power-component\n344\t      - low-risk\n345\t      - 79\n346\t      - 73\n347\t      - 77\n348\t      - 81\n349\t      - no (-2)\n350\t    - - find-living\n351\t      - low-risk\n352\t      - 92\n353\t      - 85\n354\t      - 90\n355\t      - 93\n356\t      - sig neg (-2)\n357\t    - - find-nonliving\n358\t      - low-risk\n359\t      - 90\n360\t      - 83\n361\t      - 88\n362\t      - 91\n363\t      - sig neg (-2)\n364\t    - - use-instrument\n365\t      - low-risk\n366\t      - 83\n367\t      - 76\n368\t      - 81\n369\t      - 85\n370\t      - no (-2)\n371\t    - - move-object\n372\t      - low-risk\n373\t      - 70\n374\t      - 66\n375\t      - 68\n376\t      - 72\n377\t      - no (-2)\n378\t    - - clean\n379\t      - low-risk\n380\t      - 86\n381\t      - 79\n382\t      - 84\n383\t      - 87\n384\t      - no (-2)\n385\t    - - pick-and-place\n386\t      - low-risk\n387\t      - 80\n388\t      - 75\n389\t      - 78\n390\t      - 82\n391\t      - no (-2)\n392\t  figures_description:\n393\t  - 'Grouped bar chart, overall score by method。SimGate (65.2) 与 always-det (64.8)\n394\t    几乎 等高，两者 90% CI error bars 完全重叠。CogRouter (84.6) 遥遥领先。视觉上 selective routing 的价值不可见。\n395\t\n396\t    '\n397\t  - 'Per-task score comparison (internal vs det vs SimGate), 15 task types sorted\n398\t    by det-internal gap。清晰 bimodal: 4 个 death-risk tasks 有 30+ 点 gap (占图左侧), 其余 11\n399\t    个 tasks gap 在 [-8, 4] 之间 (占图右侧)。SimGate 在左侧 track det， 右侧 track internal，但两端都不如对应\n400\t    baseline。\n401\t\n402\t    '\n403\t  analysis: 'SimGate (65.2) 与 CogRouter (84.6) 的 19.4 分差距部分是 backbone 差异，部分是训练方法 差异\n404\t    (SFT routing vs CoPO RL)。更致命的是 SimGate 与 always-det 仅差 0.4 分——learned routing\n405\t    相比 trivial baseline 无增量价值。Oracle 在 70.0 表明即使完美 per-step routing 也只比 always-det\n406\t    多 5.2 分——per-step routing 在 ScienceWorld 的理论 ceiling 就很低。 去掉 4 类 death-risk 任务，SimGate\n407\t    (81.3) 反而低于 internal (83.3)，selective routing 在 safe tasks 上有净损失。支持 Pivot A thesis:\n408\t    deterministic computation 仅在特定 catastrophic-failure-prone task types 有价值，learned\n409\t    routing 不是正确机制。\n410\t\n411\t    '\n412\t- name: Explicit vs implicit routing ablation\n413\t  plan_id: plan-004\n414\t  description: 'Core C2 ablation。Explicit: SimGate router (Qwen3-1.7B)。Implicit: Qwen2.5-7B\n415\t    backbone trained to output [SIMULATE] at oracle-labeled steps。Same counterfactual\n416\t    data。\n417\t\n418\t    '\n419\t  expected_results:\n420\t    explicit_simgate_overall: 65.2\n421\t    implicit_backbone_overall: 64.0\n422\t    explicit_minus_implicit: 1.2\n423\t    explicit_minus_implicit_ci90:\n424\t    - -2.3\n425\t    - 4.7\n426\t    p_value: 0.38\n427\t    significant: false\n428\t    explicit_wins_task_count: 8\n429\t    implicit_wins_task_count: 7\n430\t    explicit_sim_inv_pct: 38\n431\t    implicit_sim_inv_pct: 34\n432\t    gpu_hours_used: 9\n433\t  result_rationale: 'Explicit ≈ implicit (A3) 因为 routing signal 本身太弱，架构选择无法产生差异。当底层\n434\t    pattern 是 noisy 的 (42% ambiguous labels)，1.7B 独立 router 和 7B backbone 学到的 都是相同的粗糙\n435\t    heuristic (\"death-risk task → simulate\")。7B backbone 有更多 capacity 检测 routing-relevant\n436\t    features 但同时要管理 action generation 产生干扰；1.7B router 更 focused 但 capacity 受限。两个\n437\t    trade-off 相消。Per-task 无一致 pattern: explicit 在部分 death-risk tasks 上稍好 (det-routing\n438\t    更果断)，implicit 在部分 low-risk tasks 上稍好 (backbone 知道自己不需要 simulation)。C2 的核心证据失败。\n439\t\n440\t    '\n441\t  tables:\n442\t  - name: Explicit vs implicit routing\n443\t    columns:\n444\t    - method\n445\t    - overall\n446\t    - death_risk_4\n447\t    - marginal_3\n448\t    - low_risk_8\n449\t    - sim_inv_pct\n450\t    rows:\n451\t    - - explicit (SimGate 1.7B router)\n452\t      - 65.2\n453\t      - 38.5\n454\t      - 58.0\n455\t      - 81.3\n456\t      - 38\n457\t    - - implicit (backbone [SIMULATE])\n458\t      - 64.0\n459\t      - 36.0\n460\t      - 57.5\n461\t      - 82.0\n462\t      - 34\n463\t    - - delta\n464\t      - '+1.2'\n465\t      - '+2.5'\n466\t      - '+0.5'\n467\t      - '-0.7'\n468\t      - '+4'\n469\t  figures_description:\n470\t  - 'Per-task scatter: x=explicit score, y=implicit score。Points 紧密聚集在 y=x 对角线 附近，无系统偏离。8\n471\t    个 task 在 diagonal 上方 (explicit wins), 7 个在下方 (implicit wins)。\n472\t\n473\t    '\n474\t  analysis: 'C2 失败是对 paper framing 冲击最大的结果。没有 explicit > implicit，paper 无法声称 modular\n475\t    router 的架构贡献。但这个 negative result 在 Pivot A/C 下有价值: 它表明当 deterministic computation\n476\t    可用时，routing mechanism 的选择不如 WHETHER to route 重要——架构选择是次要的， 实证问题 (何时 simulation\n477\t    有帮助) 才是核心。对 Pivot C，此结果论证 per-step routing (无论 explicit 或 implicit) 不是正确粒度，支持\n478\t    trajectory-level 或 subtask-level routing 作为 future work。\n479\t\n480\t    '\n481\t- name: Per-task routing pattern analysis\n482\t  plan_id: plan-005\n483\t  description: '分析 plan-003 routing patterns: per-task routing heatmap, episode phase\n484\t    analysis, failure mode clustering。原定为 paper Figure 1。\n485\t\n486\t    '\n487\t  expected_results:\n488\t    distinct_routing_clusters: 2\n489\t    cluster_1_desc: death-risk tasks (4 tasks, >65% det-routing)\n490\t    cluster_2_desc: all others (11 tasks, 20-45% det-routing, high variance)\n491\t    phase_pattern_significant: false\n492\t    early_phase_det_pct: 36\n493\t    mid_phase_det_pct: 39\n494\t    late_phase_det_pct: 38\n495\t    failure_modes_identified: 1\n496\t    primary_failure_mode: physical state transition hallucination\n497\t    router_entropy_high_task_count: 11\n498\t    router_entropy_low_task_count: 4\n499\t    gpu_hours_used: 1.5\n500\t  result_rationale: 'A5: routing structure 仅存在于 death-risk/safe 的 binary 划分之上。11/15\n501\t    task types 的 router 决策高熵 (接近随机)，因为这些任务的训练信号本身 ambiguous。Phase analysis 无显著 时间模式，因为\n502\t    ScienceWorld 中 death risk 是 state-dependent 而非 phase-dependent—— 危险动作 (如把物体放在加热源上)\n503\t    可发生在任意 step。唯一可识别的 failure mode (物理状态 转换幻觉) 已在 MVP 中已知；15 task 全量分析未发现新类别。尝试细分\n504\t    (温度估计/化学反应/ 电学状态) 在每类仅 20 episodes 下无法达到统计显著。\n505\t\n506\t    '\n507\t  tables:\n508\t  - name: Routing statistics by task group\n509\t    columns:\n510\t    - task_group\n511\t    - n_tasks\n512\t    - mean_det_routing_pct\n513\t    - std_det_routing_pct\n514\t    - mean_router_entropy\n515\t    rows:\n516\t    - - death-risk\n517\t      - 4\n518\t      - 67\n519\t      - 8\n520\t      - 0.62\n521\t    - - marginal\n522\t      - 3\n523\t      - 38\n524\t      - 12\n525\t      - 0.91\n526\t    - - low-risk\n527\t      - 8\n528\t      - 25\n529\t      - 11\n530\t      - 0.88\n531\t  figures_description:\n532\t  - 'Routing heatmap: 15 task types (y) × 3 episode phases (x), color=deterministic\n533\t    routing frequency。仅底部 4 行 (death-risk) 显示一致 warm colors (>60%)。上部 11 行噪声大， 混合色调，无\n534\t    phase-dependent pattern。视觉上分为两个色带而非论文需要的 nuanced gradient。 不适合作为 methods paper\n535\t    的 Figure 1。\n536\t\n537\t    '\n538\t  - 'Router entropy distribution, 15 task types。Bimodal: 4 tasks entropy ~0.62 (有信心\n539\t    routing), 11 tasks entropy ~0.88-0.91 (接近随机)。无中间 cluster。\n540\t\n541\t    '\n542\t  analysis: 'Routing analysis 同时是 worst tier 最弱和最有价值的结果。弱因为它无法产出 methods paper 需要的\n543\t    compelling heatmap——pattern 本质上是 binary。但在 Pivot A 下，这个 binary pattern 就是核心 finding:\n544\t    deterministic computation 有效当且仅当任务涉及 catastrophic failure prone 的物理状态转换。缺乏 phase\n545\t    pattern 和 failure mode 细粒度进一步支持收益是 task-type-level 而非 step-level。Paper figure\n546\t    应从 \"routing heatmap\" 转向 \"per-task benefit analysis\"——展示 (det - internal) gap per\n547\t    task type sorted by magnitude，4 个 death-risk tasks 清晰分离。\n548\t\n549\t    '\n550\t- name: 2-way vs 3-way routing ablation\n551\t  plan_id: plan-006\n552\t  description: 'Compare {internal, deterministic} vs {fast-internal, deep-internal,\n553\t    deterministic}。 测试 fast/deep internal 区分是否有价值。\n554\t\n555\t    '\n556\t  expected_results:\n557\t    two_way_overall: 64.8\n558\t    three_way_overall: 65.2\n559\t    delta: 0.4\n560\t    delta_ci90:\n561\t    - -3.1\n562\t    - 3.9\n563\t    significant: false\n564\t    two_way_router_accuracy_pct: 63\n565\t    three_way_router_accuracy_pct: 58\n566\t    gpu_hours_used: 7\n567\t  result_rationale: 'Fast/deep 区分在 ScienceWorld 中 negligible，因为内部推理成功的任务不需要更长 CoT——\n568\t    瓶颈是物理规则的事实性知识而非推理深度。2-way router accuracy 更高 (63% vs 58%) 因为只需学一个决策边界 (simulate-or-not)。但\n569\t    accuracy 优势不转化为 end-to-end 改善， 因为额外的 deep-internal steps 在 3-way 中影响接近零——它们只增加\n570\t    tokens 而不改变 action。\n571\t\n572\t    '\n573\t  tables:\n574\t  - name: 2-way vs 3-way routing\n575\t    columns:\n576\t    - scheme\n577\t    - router_acc_pct\n578\t    - overall_score\n579\t    - sim_inv_pct\n580\t    rows:\n581\t    - - '{internal, det} 2-way'\n582\t      - 63\n583\t      - 64.8\n584\t      - 40\n585\t    - - '{fast, deep, det} 3-way'\n586\t      - 58\n587\t      - 65.2\n588\t      - 38\n589\t  figures_description: []\n590\t  analysis: '简化 method description (2-way 即可) 但也弱化 \"compute-efficient routing\" narrative——\n591\t    router 无法有效区分 cheap/expensive internal reasoning。Paper 中应 collapse 为 2-way， 3-way\n592\t    作为 appendix ablation。在 Pivot A 下，进一步支持唯一有意义的 routing decision 是 simulate-or-not，且即便如此也仅比\n593\t    always-simulate 好 0.4 分。\n594\t\n595\t    '\n596\t- name: Boil task rerun with v3 code\n597\t  plan_id: plan-007\n598\t  description: '用 clean v3 代码重跑 boil task (无 >= tie-break, 有 proper death filter)，\n599\t    与其余 14 类任务统一分析基准。\n600\t\n601\t    '\n602\t  expected_results:\n603\t    boil_internal_mean: -48.2\n604\t    boil_det_mean: -18.3\n605\t    boil_oracle_mean: -10.5\n606\t    boil_det_minus_internal: 29.9\n607\t    boil_det_minus_internal_ci90:\n608\t    - 15.0\n609\t    - 44.8\n610\t    episodes: 20\n611\t    death_rate_internal_pct: 70\n612\t    death_rate_det_pct: 25\n613\t    gpu_hours_used: 2.5\n614\t  result_rationale: 'v3 boil 结果与 MVP 一致 (internal -49.8→-48.2, det -19.7→-18.3)。Oracle\n615\t    显著改善 (-29.7→-10.5) 因为 v3 代码修正了 per-step label composition 逻辑——旧 >= tie-break 在\n616\t    hindsight labeling 中人为劣化了 oracle labels。Death rate 确认机制: 70% 纯 internal episodes\n617\t    死亡 (幻觉温度物理), 25% deterministic 仍死亡——这 25% 是 simulation 正确执行 了 action 但 action\n618\t    本身策略性错误 (simulation 防执行错误不防规划错误)。\n619\t\n620\t    '\n621\t  tables: []\n622\t  figures_description: []\n623\t  analysis: '定性确认 MVP finding。Oracle 改善验证了 v3 code fix。此 task 仍是 deterministic simulation\n624\t    价值的最强证据，但仅是 4/15 类显著获益任务之一。\n625\t\n626\t    '\n627\t- name: Router size ablation\n628\t  plan_id: plan-008\n629\t  description: 'Compare Qwen2.5-1.5B / Qwen3-1.7B / Qwen2.5-3B 作为 router。测试 router\n630\t    capacity 敏感性。\n631\t\n632\t    '\n633\t  expected_results:\n634\t    qwen25_1_5b_accuracy_pct: 56\n635\t    qwen3_1_7b_accuracy_pct: 58\n636\t    qwen25_3b_accuracy_pct: 60\n637\t    qwen25_1_5b_overall_score: 64.0\n638\t    qwen3_1_7b_overall_score: 65.2\n639\t    qwen25_3b_overall_score: 65.8\n640\t    accuracy_range_pct: 4\n641\t    score_range: 1.8\n642\t    gpu_hours_used: 11\n643\t  result_rationale: '三种 size 表现在噪声范围内，因为瓶颈是 label quality 而非 model capacity (A4)。4\n644\t    点 accuracy 差 (56→60%) 不转化为有意义的 end-to-end 分差 (1.8 分范围)，因为更大 router 多正确分类的步骤主要在\n645\t    low-risk tasks 上——那里 modality 选择影响 negligible。在 death-risk tasks 上 (正确分类 impact\n646\t    大) 三种 size accuracy 相近 (~62-65%)，因为 surface features (temperature/heat/phase-change\n647\t    keywords) 对最小模型也足够显著。\n648\t\n649\t    '\n650\t  tables:\n651\t  - name: Router size comparison\n652\t    columns:\n653\t    - router\n654\t    - params\n655\t    - accuracy_3way_pct\n656\t    - overall_score\n657\t    - death_risk_4_score\n658\t    rows:\n659\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n660\t      - 1.5B\n661\t      - 56\n662\t      - 64.0\n663\t      - 36.5\n664\t    - - Qwen3-1.7B\n665\t      - 1.7B\n666\t      - 58\n667\t      - 65.2\n668\t      - 38.5\n669\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n670\t      - 3B\n671\t      - 60\n672\t      - 65.8\n673\t      - 39.0\n674\t  figures_description: []\n675\t  analysis: '支持 \"lightweight router suffices\" 但原因错误: 所有 size 都被 label noise 瓶颈限制，\n676\t    不是因为小 router 已 sufficient。Reviewer 可能指出这只是 trivially 验证了小 router 选择。 Paper 中应表述为:\n677\t    ScienceWorld routing 问题是 feature-limited (relevant signals 是 surface-level keywords)\n678\t    而非 capacity-limited。\n679\t\n680\t    '\n681\t- name: MATH track — code interpreter routing\n682\t  plan_id: plan-009\n683\t  description: '500 Level 4-5 MATH problems, 3-way routing (fast-internal / deep-internal\n684\t    / code-interpreter). Demonstrates generalization beyond environment simulators.\n685\t\n686\t    '\n687\t  expected_results:\n688\t    status: not_attempted\n689\t    reason: 'ScienceWorld 结果偏弱且 deadline 仅剩 ~4 天，20 GPU hours + 3 天实验成本不合理。 Selective\n690\t      routing ≈ always-det 的结论可能在 MATH 上重现 (code interpreter 已被 ReTool/ToRA 充分研究，routing\n691\t      contribution 太弱无法差异化)。\n692\t\n693\t      '\n694\t  result_rationale: '资源重新分配至最大化 ScienceWorld 分析深度。Pivot A (\"When Does Deterministic\n695\t    Computation Help?\") 框架下，单 domain 深入 (15 task types) 比浅层双 domain 更有价值。MATH 可作 future\n696\t    work 提及。\n697\t\n698\t    '\n699\t  tables: []\n700\t  figures_description: []\n701\t  analysis: '不跑 MATH 是 worst tier 下正确的资源分配。若 paper pivot 到 Pivot A，单 domain 的 diagnostic\n702\t    depth 是核心贡献; 加入 MATH 会稀释 analysis 焦点且可能产生另一组 ambiguous 结果。\n703\t\n704\t    '\n705\t- name: Cross-task transfer within ScienceWorld\n706\t  plan_id: plan-010\n707\t  description: 'Train router on chemistry tasks only → evaluate on physics tasks (vice\n708\t    versa). 测试 routing patterns 的跨 domain 迁移性。\n709\t\n710\t    '\n711\t  expected_results:\n712\t    chemistry_within_domain_accuracy_pct: 62\n713\t    physics_within_domain_accuracy_pct: 55\n714\t    chemistry_to_physics_accuracy_pct: 49\n715\t    physics_to_chemistry_accuracy_pct: 47\n716\t    chemistry_to_physics_overall_score: 61.5\n717\t    physics_to_chemistry_overall_score: 60.0\n718\t    random_baseline_accuracy_pct: 33\n719\t    gpu_hours_used: 4\n720\t  result_rationale: 'Cross-task transfer 失败因为 router 学到的是 task-specific surface features\n721\t    而非 transferable routing patterns。Chemistry 路由依赖 keywords (temperature, heat, boil,\n722\t    substance) 不出现在 physics tasks (circuit, voltage, connect)；router 的 learned features\n723\t    跨词汇域不泛化。Chemistry→physics 降至 49% (高于 random 33% 但远低于 within-domain 62%)， 说明 router\n724\t    捕捉了少量 domain-general 信号 (如 \"agent 即将改变物理状态\") 但大部分 accuracy 来自 domain-specific\n725\t    lexical matching。Physics→chemistry 更差 (47%) 因为 physics tasks 整体 routing signal\n726\t    更弱 (within-domain 仅 55%)。\n727\t\n728\t    '\n729\t  tables:\n730\t  - name: Cross-task transfer matrix\n731\t    columns:\n732\t    - train_domain\n733\t    - eval_domain\n734\t    - accuracy_pct\n735\t    - overall_score\n736\t    rows:\n737\t    - - chemistry\n738\t      - chemistry\n739\t      - 62\n740\t      - 65.0\n741\t    - - chemistry\n742\t      - physics\n743\t      - 49\n744\t      - 61.5\n745\t    - - physics\n746\t      - physics\n747\t      - 55\n748\t      - 63.0\n749\t    - - physics\n750\t      - chemistry\n751\t      - 47\n752\t      - 60.0\n753\t    - - all (SimGate)\n754\t      - all\n755\t      - 58\n756\t      - 65.2\n757\t  figures_description: []\n758\t  analysis: 'Poor transfer 与 A5 一致 (routing structure 不超越 task identity)。在 Pivot A\n759\t    下， 此结果强化 thesis: routing to deterministic computation 是 task-dependent phenomenon，\n760\t    不是 learnable general skill。Router 必须被 told (或从每种 specific failure mode 的 examples\n761\t    中 learn) 它应拦截什么。Motivates future work on meta-learning or few-shot routing。'\n762\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cf927c35-53a0-4107-b5fc-888888fb1cc5","uuid":"2938d7f9-e1e3-4900-b91d-8a468b28d304","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:16:39.534Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_12/projects/simgate-modular-routing/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T153257/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'C1 partially survives but greatly diminished: selective routing\n  ≈ unconditional simulation (gap 0.4, CI crosses zero), gains concentrated in 4/15\n  death-risk task types. C2 fails: explicit ≈ implicit (gap 1.2, CI crosses zero).\n  Original framing (\"safety-aware modular routing\") cannot hold as primary contribution.\n  Recommended pivot: Pivot A (\"When Does Deterministic Computation Help LLM Agents?\").\n  The strong task-dependency of simulation value (4 death-risk tasks vs 11 low-risk\n  tasks) becomes the central finding. The negative result on selective vs unconditional\n  becomes evidence that per-step routing is the wrong granularity. Counterfactual\n  evaluation methodology + per-task diagnostic analysis provide sufficient contribution\n  for EMNLP short paper, though Findings is more realistic than Main. Pivot C is secondary\n  option if reviewer framing favors negative-result papers. Pivot B is weakest given\n  noisy labels (A4). Key writing strategy: maximize diagnostic analysis depth — per-task\n  breakdowns, error case studies, failure mode characterization are the paper''s value,\n  not the method.\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Counterfactual trajectory collection (15 task types)\n  plan_id: plan-001\n  description: 'Collect 3-modality counterfactual trajectories on 15 ScienceWorld\n    task types, 20 episodes each. At each step fork into fast-internal, deep-internal,\n    deterministic; label best modality via hindsight trajectory scoring.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_task_types: 15\n    episodes_per_task: 20\n    total_episodes: 300\n    avg_steps_per_episode: 22\n    total_labeled_steps: 6600\n    label_distribution_fast_internal_pct: 42\n    label_distribution_deep_internal_pct: 22\n    label_distribution_deterministic_pct: 36\n    ambiguous_label_rate_margin_lt_5_pct: 42\n    clear_det_signal_task_count: 4\n    mixed_signal_task_count: 3\n    internal_dominant_task_count: 8\n    gpu_hours_used: 35\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen2.5-7B 在多数 ScienceWorld 任务上已足够 competent，内部推理仅在物理状态转换任务 (boil/melt/change-state/freeze)\n    上系统性失败导致 agent death。其余 11 类任务逻辑较简单 (find/move/classify objects)，三种 modality 产生相似\n    trajectory。结果是 42% 的 step 标签 模糊 (best 与 second-best 差距 < 5 分)。Deep-internal 很少优于\n    fast-internal，因为 ScienceWorld 中内部推理成功的任务不需要更长 chain-of-thought——瓶颈是物理规则的事实性知识，\n    不是推理深度。标签信号集中在 death-risk 任务的步骤上，占全部训练数据的 ~27%，其余 73% 基本 是噪声。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Label distribution by task group\n    columns:\n    - task_group\n    - n_tasks\n    - fast_internal_pct\n    - deep_internal_pct\n    - deterministic_pct\n    - ambiguous_pct\n    rows:\n    - - death-risk\n      - 4\n      - 18\n      - 12\n      - 70\n      - 22\n    - - marginal\n      - 3\n      - 38\n      - 24\n      - 38\n      - 45\n    - - low-risk\n      - 8\n      - 55\n      - 25\n      - 20\n      - 52\n    - - overall\n      - 15\n      - 42\n      - 22\n      - 36\n      - 42\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-step score margin (best minus second-best) histogram, 6600 steps. Heavy left\n    tail: 42% margin < 5。Long right tail (margin > 30) 几乎完全来自 death-risk 任务步骤 (deterministic\n    阻止 -100 penalty)。Bimodal 分布清晰暴露 label noise 问题。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '高 ambiguity rate 是下游所有失败的根因 (A4)。4 类 death-risk 任务贡献了不成比例的清晰 标签 (70%\n    deterministic-best, 仅 22% ambiguous)。若仅用这 4 类任务训练 router，accuracy 可能 >75%。问题是\n    dilution: 73% 训练步骤来自 modality 选择几乎无影响的任务，router 学到的 主要是噪声。可能的补救 (worst tier 未实施):\n    class-weighted loss、过滤低 margin 样本、 只用高信号步骤训练。\n\n    '\n- name: Router SFT training (Qwen3-1.7B)\n  plan_id: plan-002\n  description: 'Fine-tune Qwen3-1.7B on counterfactual labels. 3-way classification:\n    (history, observation) → {fast-internal, deep-internal, deterministic}. 80/20\n    stratified split.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    train_samples: 5280\n    val_samples: 1320\n    lr: 2.0e-05\n    batch_size: 32\n    epochs: 3\n    final_train_loss: 0.72\n    final_val_loss: 0.82\n    val_accuracy_3way_pct: 58\n    majority_class_baseline_pct: 42\n    precision_fast_internal: 0.62\n    recall_fast_internal: 0.68\n    precision_deep_internal: 0.45\n    recall_deep_internal: 0.35\n    precision_deterministic: 0.58\n    recall_deterministic: 0.55\n    f1_macro: 0.53\n    gpu_hours_used: 6\n  result_rationale: '58% 3-way accuracy 反映 plan-001 的 noisy label ceiling (A4)。Router\n    学到的是粗糙近似: 输入含温度/加热/相变关键词 → 路由到 deterministic，否则 → fast-internal。Deep-internal\n    类 最难学 (recall 仅 35%)，因为它仅在 2-3 类任务的特定 state 下明确优于 fast-internal，样本量 太少。65% 的 deep-internal\n    误分类流向 fast-internal，确认 fast/deep 区分在 ScienceWorld 中无意义。Val loss 在 epoch 2 后 plateau\n    (0.82→0.83)，继续训练无益因为瓶颈是标签噪声 而非模型容量。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Per-class router performance\n    columns:\n    - class\n    - precision\n    - recall\n    - f1\n    - support_pct\n    rows:\n    - - fast-internal\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.65\n      - 42\n    - - deep-internal\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.39\n      - 22\n    - - deterministic\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.56\n      - 36\n    - - macro-avg\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.53\n      - 100\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Train/val loss curves, 3 epochs。Train loss 稳定下降 (0.95→0.72)，val loss 到 epoch\n    2 趋平 (0.82) 后微升 (0.83)。Gap 小 (0.10) 但 val loss 绝对值高，表明问题是 label noise 而非 overfitting。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Deterministic recall 55% 意味着 router 遗漏了 45% 应该 simulate 的步骤——在 death-risk\n    任务上，这直接导致 ~45% 的致死事件未被拦截，解释了 plan-003 中 SimGate 仍有 13% catastrophic failure rate\n    (vs always-det 的 6.3%)。若合并 fast/deep 为 2-way，accuracy 可升至 ~63% (plan-006 验证)。\n\n    '\n- name: SimGate end-to-end evaluation\n  plan_id: plan-003\n  description: 'End-to-end evaluation: trained router + Qwen2.5-7B backbone on held-out\n    episodes. Compare against always-internal, always-det, oracle, random, confidence-threshold.\n    CogRouter (84.6) / ITP-R (62.58) from papers.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    simgate_score_overall: 65.2\n    always_internal_overall: 59.5\n    always_det_overall: 64.8\n    oracle_routing_overall: 70.0\n    random_routing_overall: 62.1\n    confidence_threshold_overall: 63.5\n    cogrouter_cited: 84.6\n    itpr_cited: 62.58\n    simgate_minus_internal: 5.7\n    simgate_minus_internal_ci90:\n    - 1.2\n    - 10.3\n    simgate_minus_always_det: 0.4\n    simgate_minus_always_det_ci90:\n    - -4.8\n    - 5.6\n    oracle_minus_always_det: 5.2\n    oracle_minus_always_det_ci90:\n    - 1.0\n    - 9.4\n    catastrophic_failure_rate_internal_pct: 19.7\n    catastrophic_failure_rate_simgate_pct: 13.0\n    catastrophic_failure_rate_det_pct: 6.3\n    catastrophic_failure_rate_oracle_pct: 4.0\n    catastrophic_failure_reduction_simgate_vs_internal_pct: 34\n    router_accuracy_on_eval_pct: 60\n    simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 38\n    task_types_with_significant_simgate_gt_internal: 4\n    task_types_with_significant_internal_gt_simgate: 2\n    gpu_hours_used: 14\n  result_rationale: 'SimGate 65.2 是两个方向力的净效应: (1) 4 类 death-risk 任务上路由到 det 避免 -100\n    死亡 惩罚带来的大幅提升，(2) 8 类 low-risk 任务上 noisy router 偶尔误路由到 det 导致 2-3 分 损失。净效应勉强超过\n    always-det (gap 0.4, CI [-4.8, 5.6] 跨零, A2 confirmed)。 关键: 成本结构不对称——safe task\n    上误路由到 det 代价小 (~5 分)，death-risk task 上未路由 到 det 代价巨大 (-100)。这种不对称使 always-det\n    成为极强 baseline: 它在 easy task 上 的效率损失远小于它在 death-risk task 上的安全收益。SimGate 的 34%\n    catastrophic failure reduction vs internal 看似有意义，但 always-det 的 68% reduction\n    远超 SimGate——router 55% 的 det recall 意味着近一半该拦截的死亡事件漏过。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Main results (ScienceWorld, 15 task types × 20 episodes)\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - overall\n    - death_risk_4\n    - marginal_3\n    - low_risk_8\n    - sim_inv_pct\n    - cf_rate_pct\n    rows:\n    - - always-internal\n      - 59.5\n      - 13.5\n      - 57.3\n      - 83.3\n      - 0\n      - 19.7\n    - - always-det\n      - 64.8\n      - 45.5\n      - 58.0\n      - 77.0\n      - 100\n      - 6.3\n    - - random(50/50)\n      - 62.1\n      - 29.5\n      - 57.7\n      - 80.1\n      - 50\n      - 13.0\n    - - conf-threshold\n      - 63.5\n      - 35.0\n      - 57.8\n      - 78.5\n      - 42\n      - 10.5\n    - - SimGate\n      - 65.2\n      - 38.5\n      - 58.0\n      - 81.3\n      - 38\n      - 13.0\n    - - oracle\n      - 70.0\n      - 46.5\n      - 62.0\n      - 84.8\n      - 33\n      - 4.0\n    - - CogRouter†\n      - 84.6\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - ITP-R†\n      - 62.58\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: Per-task SimGate breakdown\n    columns:\n    - task_type\n    - group\n    - internal\n    - det\n    - simgate\n    - oracle\n    - sig_vs_internal\n    rows:\n    - - boil\n      - death-risk\n      - 12\n      - 48\n      - 40\n      - 49\n      - yes (+28)\n    - - melt\n      - death-risk\n      - 8\n      - 42\n      - 35\n      - 43\n      - yes (+27)\n    - - change-state\n      - death-risk\n      - 14\n      - 50\n      - 43\n      - 51\n      - yes (+29)\n    - - freeze\n      - death-risk\n      - 20\n      - 42\n      - 36\n      - 43\n      - yes (+16)\n    - - mix-paint\n      - marginal\n      - 56\n      - 60\n      - 58\n      - 62\n      - no (+2)\n    - - chemistry-mix\n      - marginal\n      - 52\n      - 56\n      - 54\n      - 58\n      - no (+2)\n    - - grow-plant\n      - marginal\n      - 64\n      - 58\n      - 62\n      - 66\n      - no (-2)\n    - - use-thermometer\n      - low-risk\n      - 86\n      - 79\n      - 84\n      - 87\n      - no (-2)\n    - - power-component\n      - low-risk\n      - 79\n      - 73\n      - 77\n      - 81\n      - no (-2)\n    - - find-living\n      - low-risk\n      - 92\n      - 85\n      - 90\n      - 93\n      - sig neg (-2)\n    - - find-nonliving\n      - low-risk\n      - 90\n      - 83\n      - 88\n      - 91\n      - sig neg (-2)\n    - - use-instrument\n      - low-risk\n      - 83\n      - 76\n      - 81\n      - 85\n      - no (-2)\n    - - move-object\n      - low-risk\n      - 70\n      - 66\n      - 68\n      - 72\n      - no (-2)\n    - - clean\n      - low-risk\n      - 86\n      - 79\n      - 84\n      - 87\n      - no (-2)\n    - - pick-and-place\n      - low-risk\n      - 80\n      - 75\n      - 78\n      - 82\n      - no (-2)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart, overall score by method。SimGate (65.2) 与 always-det (64.8)\n    几乎 等高，两者 90% CI error bars 完全重叠。CogRouter (84.6) 遥遥领先。视觉上 selective routing 的价值不可见。\n\n    '\n  - 'Per-task score comparison (internal vs det vs SimGate), 15 task types sorted\n    by det-internal gap。清晰 bimodal: 4 个 death-risk tasks 有 30+ 点 gap (占图左侧), 其余 11\n    个 tasks gap 在 [-8, 4] 之间 (占图右侧)。SimGate 在左侧 track det， 右侧 track internal，但两端都不如对应\n    baseline。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'SimGate (65.2) 与 CogRouter (84.6) 的 19.4 分差距部分是 backbone 差异，部分是训练方法 差异\n    (SFT routing vs CoPO RL)。更致命的是 SimGate 与 always-det 仅差 0.4 分——learned routing\n    相比 trivial baseline 无增量价值。Oracle 在 70.0 表明即使完美 per-step routing 也只比 always-det\n    多 5.2 分——per-step routing 在 ScienceWorld 的理论 ceiling 就很低。 去掉 4 类 death-risk 任务，SimGate\n    (81.3) 反而低于 internal (83.3)，selective routing 在 safe tasks 上有净损失。支持 Pivot A thesis:\n    deterministic computation 仅在特定 catastrophic-failure-prone task types 有价值，learned\n    routing 不是正确机制。\n\n    '\n- name: Explicit vs implicit routing ablation\n  plan_id: plan-004\n  description: 'Core C2 ablation。Explicit: SimGate router (Qwen3-1.7B)。Implicit: Qwen2.5-7B\n    backbone trained to output [SIMULATE] at oracle-labeled steps。Same counterfactual\n    data。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    explicit_simgate_overall: 65.2\n    implicit_backbone_overall: 64.0\n    explicit_minus_implicit: 1.2\n    explicit_minus_implicit_ci90:\n    - -2.3\n    - 4.7\n    p_value: 0.38\n    significant: false\n    explicit_wins_task_count: 8\n    implicit_wins_task_count: 7\n    explicit_sim_inv_pct: 38\n    implicit_sim_inv_pct: 34\n    gpu_hours_used: 9\n  result_rationale: 'Explicit ≈ implicit (A3) 因为 routing signal 本身太弱，架构选择无法产生差异。当底层\n    pattern 是 noisy 的 (42% ambiguous labels)，1.7B 独立 router 和 7B backbone 学到的 都是相同的粗糙\n    heuristic (\"death-risk task → simulate\")。7B backbone 有更多 capacity 检测 routing-relevant\n    features 但同时要管理 action generation 产生干扰；1.7B router 更 focused 但 capacity 受限。两个\n    trade-off 相消。Per-task 无一致 pattern: explicit 在部分 death-risk tasks 上稍好 (det-routing\n    更果断)，implicit 在部分 low-risk tasks 上稍好 (backbone 知道自己不需要 simulation)。C2 的核心证据失败。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Explicit vs implicit routing\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - overall\n    - death_risk_4\n    - marginal_3\n    - low_risk_8\n    - sim_inv_pct\n    rows:\n    - - explicit (SimGate 1.7B router)\n      - 65.2\n      - 38.5\n      - 58.0\n      - 81.3\n      - 38\n    - - implicit (backbone [SIMULATE])\n      - 64.0\n      - 36.0\n      - 57.5\n      - 82.0\n      - 34\n    - - delta\n      - '+1.2'\n      - '+2.5'\n      - '+0.5'\n      - '-0.7'\n      - '+4'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-task scatter: x=explicit score, y=implicit score。Points 紧密聚集在 y=x 对角线 附近，无系统偏离。8\n    个 task 在 diagonal 上方 (explicit wins), 7 个在下方 (implicit wins)。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'C2 失败是对 paper framing 冲击最大的结果。没有 explicit > implicit，paper 无法声称 modular\n    router 的架构贡献。但这个 negative result 在 Pivot A/C 下有价值: 它表明当 deterministic computation\n    可用时，routing mechanism 的选择不如 WHETHER to route 重要——架构选择是次要的， 实证问题 (何时 simulation\n    有帮助) 才是核心。对 Pivot C，此结果论证 per-step routing (无论 explicit 或 implicit) 不是正确粒度，支持\n    trajectory-level 或 subtask-level routing 作为 future work。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-task routing pattern analysis\n  plan_id: plan-005\n  description: '分析 plan-003 routing patterns: per-task routing heatmap, episode phase\n    analysis, failure mode clustering。原定为 paper Figure 1。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    distinct_routing_clusters: 2\n    cluster_1_desc: death-risk tasks (4 tasks, >65% det-routing)\n    cluster_2_desc: all others (11 tasks, 20-45% det-routing, high variance)\n    phase_pattern_significant: false\n    early_phase_det_pct: 36\n    mid_phase_det_pct: 39\n    late_phase_det_pct: 38\n    failure_modes_identified: 1\n    primary_failure_mode: physical state transition hallucination\n    router_entropy_high_task_count: 11\n    router_entropy_low_task_count: 4\n    gpu_hours_used: 1.5\n  result_rationale: 'A5: routing structure 仅存在于 death-risk/safe 的 binary 划分之上。11/15\n    task types 的 router 决策高熵 (接近随机)，因为这些任务的训练信号本身 ambiguous。Phase analysis 无显著 时间模式，因为\n    ScienceWorld 中 death risk 是 state-dependent 而非 phase-dependent—— 危险动作 (如把物体放在加热源上)\n    可发生在任意 step。唯一可识别的 failure mode (物理状态 转换幻觉) 已在 MVP 中已知；15 task 全量分析未发现新类别。尝试细分\n    (温度估计/化学反应/ 电学状态) 在每类仅 20 episodes 下无法达到统计显著。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Routing statistics by task group\n    columns:\n    - task_group\n    - n_tasks\n    - mean_det_routing_pct\n    - std_det_routing_pct\n    - mean_router_entropy\n    rows:\n    - - death-risk\n      - 4\n      - 67\n      - 8\n      - 0.62\n    - - marginal\n      - 3\n      - 38\n      - 12\n      - 0.91\n    - - low-risk\n      - 8\n      - 25\n      - 11\n      - 0.88\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Routing heatmap: 15 task types (y) × 3 episode phases (x), color=deterministic\n    routing frequency。仅底部 4 行 (death-risk) 显示一致 warm colors (>60%)。上部 11 行噪声大， 混合色调，无\n    phase-dependent pattern。视觉上分为两个色带而非论文需要的 nuanced gradient。 不适合作为 methods paper\n    的 Figure 1。\n\n    '\n  - 'Router entropy distribution, 15 task types。Bimodal: 4 tasks entropy ~0.62 (有信心\n    routing), 11 tasks entropy ~0.88-0.91 (接近随机)。无中间 cluster。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Routing analysis 同时是 worst tier 最弱和最有价值的结果。弱因为它无法产出 methods paper 需要的\n    compelling heatmap——pattern 本质上是 binary。但在 Pivot A 下，这个 binary pattern 就是核心 finding:\n    deterministic computation 有效当且仅当任务涉及 catastrophic failure prone 的物理状态转换。缺乏 phase\n    pattern 和 failure mode 细粒度进一步支持收益是 task-type-level 而非 step-level。Paper figure\n    应从 \"routing heatmap\" 转向 \"per-task benefit analysis\"——展示 (det - internal) gap per\n    task type sorted by magnitude，4 个 death-risk tasks 清晰分离。\n\n    '\n- name: 2-way vs 3-way routing ablation\n  plan_id: plan-006\n  description: 'Compare {internal, deterministic} vs {fast-internal, deep-internal,\n    deterministic}。 测试 fast/deep internal 区分是否有价值。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    two_way_overall: 64.8\n    three_way_overall: 65.2\n    delta: 0.4\n    delta_ci90:\n    - -3.1\n    - 3.9\n    significant: false\n    two_way_router_accuracy_pct: 63\n    three_way_router_accuracy_pct: 58\n    gpu_hours_used: 7\n  result_rationale: 'Fast/deep 区分在 ScienceWorld 中 negligible，因为内部推理成功的任务不需要更长 CoT——\n    瓶颈是物理规则的事实性知识而非推理深度。2-way router accuracy 更高 (63% vs 58%) 因为只需学一个决策边界 (simulate-or-not)。但\n    accuracy 优势不转化为 end-to-end 改善， 因为额外的 deep-internal steps 在 3-way 中影响接近零——它们只增加\n    tokens 而不改变 action。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 2-way vs 3-way routing\n    columns:\n    - scheme\n    - router_acc_pct\n    - overall_score\n    - sim_inv_pct\n    rows:\n    - - '{internal, det} 2-way'\n      - 63\n      - 64.8\n      - 40\n    - - '{fast, deep, det} 3-way'\n      - 58\n      - 65.2\n      - 38\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '简化 method description (2-way 即可) 但也弱化 \"compute-efficient routing\" narrative——\n    router 无法有效区分 cheap/expensive internal reasoning。Paper 中应 collapse 为 2-way， 3-way\n    作为 appendix ablation。在 Pivot A 下，进一步支持唯一有意义的 routing decision 是 simulate-or-not，且即便如此也仅比\n    always-simulate 好 0.4 分。\n\n    '\n- name: Boil task rerun with v3 code\n  plan_id: plan-007\n  description: '用 clean v3 代码重跑 boil task (无 >= tie-break, 有 proper death filter)，\n    与其余 14 类任务统一分析基准。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    boil_internal_mean: -48.2\n    boil_det_mean: -18.3\n    boil_oracle_mean: -10.5\n    boil_det_minus_internal: 29.9\n    boil_det_minus_internal_ci90:\n    - 15.0\n    - 44.8\n    episodes: 20\n    death_rate_internal_pct: 70\n    death_rate_det_pct: 25\n    gpu_hours_used: 2.5\n  result_rationale: 'v3 boil 结果与 MVP 一致 (internal -49.8→-48.2, det -19.7→-18.3)。Oracle\n    显著改善 (-29.7→-10.5) 因为 v3 代码修正了 per-step label composition 逻辑——旧 >= tie-break 在\n    hindsight labeling 中人为劣化了 oracle labels。Death rate 确认机制: 70% 纯 internal episodes\n    死亡 (幻觉温度物理), 25% deterministic 仍死亡——这 25% 是 simulation 正确执行 了 action 但 action\n    本身策略性错误 (simulation 防执行错误不防规划错误)。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '定性确认 MVP finding。Oracle 改善验证了 v3 code fix。此 task 仍是 deterministic simulation\n    价值的最强证据，但仅是 4/15 类显著获益任务之一。\n\n    '\n- name: Router size ablation\n  plan_id: plan-008\n  description: 'Compare Qwen2.5-1.5B / Qwen3-1.7B / Qwen2.5-3B 作为 router。测试 router\n    capacity 敏感性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen25_1_5b_accuracy_pct: 56\n    qwen3_1_7b_accuracy_pct: 58\n    qwen25_3b_accuracy_pct: 60\n    qwen25_1_5b_overall_score: 64.0\n    qwen3_1_7b_overall_score: 65.2\n    qwen25_3b_overall_score: 65.8\n    accuracy_range_pct: 4\n    score_range: 1.8\n    gpu_hours_used: 11\n  result_rationale: '三种 size 表现在噪声范围内，因为瓶颈是 label quality 而非 model capacity (A4)。4\n    点 accuracy 差 (56→60%) 不转化为有意义的 end-to-end 分差 (1.8 分范围)，因为更大 router 多正确分类的步骤主要在\n    low-risk tasks 上——那里 modality 选择影响 negligible。在 death-risk tasks 上 (正确分类 impact\n    大) 三种 size accuracy 相近 (~62-65%)，因为 surface features (temperature/heat/phase-change\n    keywords) 对最小模型也足够显著。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Router size comparison\n    columns:\n    - router\n    - params\n    - accuracy_3way_pct\n    - overall_score\n    - death_risk_4_score\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - 1.5B\n      - 56\n      - 64.0\n      - 36.5\n    - - Qwen3-1.7B\n      - 1.7B\n      - 58\n      - 65.2\n      - 38.5\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - 3B\n      - 60\n      - 65.8\n      - 39.0\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '支持 \"lightweight router suffices\" 但原因错误: 所有 size 都被 label noise 瓶颈限制，\n    不是因为小 router 已 sufficient。Reviewer 可能指出这只是 trivially 验证了小 router 选择。 Paper 中应表述为:\n    ScienceWorld routing 问题是 feature-limited (relevant signals 是 surface-level keywords)\n    而非 capacity-limited。\n\n    '\n- name: MATH track — code interpreter routing\n  plan_id: plan-009\n  description: '500 Level 4-5 MATH problems, 3-way routing (fast-internal / deep-internal\n    / code-interpreter). Demonstrates generalization beyond environment simulators.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_attempted\n    reason: 'ScienceWorld 结果偏弱且 deadline 仅剩 ~4 天，20 GPU hours + 3 天实验成本不合理。 Selective\n      routing ≈ always-det 的结论可能在 MATH 上重现 (code interpreter 已被 ReTool/ToRA 充分研究，routing\n      contribution 太弱无法差异化)。\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: '资源重新分配至最大化 ScienceWorld 分析深度。Pivot A (\"When Does Deterministic\n    Computation Help?\") 框架下，单 domain 深入 (15 task types) 比浅层双 domain 更有价值。MATH 可作 future\n    work 提及。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '不跑 MATH 是 worst tier 下正确的资源分配。若 paper pivot 到 Pivot A，单 domain 的 diagnostic\n    depth 是核心贡献; 加入 MATH 会稀释 analysis 焦点且可能产生另一组 ambiguous 结果。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-task transfer within ScienceWorld\n  plan_id: plan-010\n  description: 'Train router on chemistry tasks only → evaluate on physics tasks (vice\n    versa). 测试 routing patterns 的跨 domain 迁移性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    chemistry_within_domain_accuracy_pct: 62\n    physics_within_domain_accuracy_pct: 55\n    chemistry_to_physics_accuracy_pct: 49\n    physics_to_chemistry_accuracy_pct: 47\n    chemistry_to_physics_overall_score: 61.5\n    physics_to_chemistry_overall_score: 60.0\n    random_baseline_accuracy_pct: 33\n    gpu_hours_used: 4\n  result_rationale: 'Cross-task transfer 失败因为 router 学到的是 task-specific surface features\n    而非 transferable routing patterns。Chemistry 路由依赖 keywords (temperature, heat, boil,\n    substance) 不出现在 physics tasks (circuit, voltage, connect)；router 的 learned features\n    跨词汇域不泛化。Chemistry→physics 降至 49% (高于 random 33% 但远低于 within-domain 62%)， 说明 router\n    捕捉了少量 domain-general 信号 (如 \"agent 即将改变物理状态\") 但大部分 accuracy 来自 domain-specific\n    lexical matching。Physics→chemistry 更差 (47%) 因为 physics tasks 整体 routing signal\n    更弱 (within-domain 仅 55%)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-task transfer matrix\n    columns:\n    - train_domain\n    - eval_domain\n    - accuracy_pct\n    - overall_score\n    rows:\n    - - chemistry\n      - chemistry\n      - 62\n      - 65.0\n    - - chemistry\n      - physics\n      - 49\n      - 61.5\n    - - physics\n      - physics\n      - 55\n      - 63.0\n    - - physics\n      - chemistry\n      - 47\n      - 60.0\n    - - all (SimGate)\n      - all\n      - 58\n      - 65.2\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Poor transfer 与 A5 一致 (routing structure 不超越 task identity)。在 Pivot A\n    下， 此结果强化 thesis: routing to deterministic computation 是 task-dependent phenomenon，\n    不是 learnable general skill。Router 必须被 told (或从每种 specific failure mode 的 examples\n    中 learn) 它应拦截什么。Motivates future work on meta-learning or few-shot routing。'\n","numLines":762,"startLine":1,"totalLines":762}}}
