ainst planned experiments in YAML)\n6. **Soundness rating** (1-5)\n7. **Overall score** (1-6 scale)\n8. **Confidence** (1-5)\n\nBe rigorous. Evaluate: Is the counterfactual methodology sound? Are baselines fair? Are statistical tests appropriate? Is the experimental scale sufficient? Are negative results convincingly established? Are there confounds?","uuid":"5141c599-9f58-4243-b999-54be8b436217","session_id":"cf927c35-53a0-4107-b5fc-888888fb1cc5"}
